{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35825","headline":"送谭孝廉赴举 · 李咸用","name":"送谭孝廉赴举","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鼓鼙声里寻诗礼，戈戟林间入镐京。\n好事尽从难处得，少年无向易中轻。\n也知贵贱皆前定，未见疎慵遂有成。\n吾道近来稀後进，善开金口荅公卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35825.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35825","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}